{
  "version": 1,
  "description": "Weight and volume number formatting golden cases run by Android WeightFormatGoldenTest and iOS WeightFormatGoldenTests. input is the editable weight text with a dot separator and no grouping (Android formatWeightInput, iOS gymMachineWeightEditText in English). display is the weight number with the language's decimal separator, up to 2 decimals and no grouping (Android formatWeightDisplay, iOS gymMachineWeightEditText). volume is a training volume number with at most 1 decimal and locale digit grouping (Android formatVolumeTotal, iOS gymVolumeText without the unit). Languages are en, uk and ru.",
